# CLI (`@dimah-s3/cli`)

Scaffold only — no dimah-s3 business logic. Pipeline: flags/prompts → `CreateConfig` → validate → copy snapshotted template → transform → install → git → next steps.

Templates SSOT: `templates/<id>/` + `templates/catalog.json` (not a workspace member). Build snapshots into `dist/templates/` (pins `@dimah-s3/*`, rejects `catalog:` / `workspace:*`, renames `.gitignore` → `_gitignore`).

New template → catalog entry + folder. New create option → field on `CreateConfig` + step/addon. Do not hand-edit `dist/templates/`.

**Detail (Read):** [docs/agents/cli.md](docs/agents/cli.md).
